</div></div></div><div class="col-xl-7"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-header"><strong>Dispositivos IoT</strong></div><div class="card-body p-0"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-hover align-middle mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Dispositivo</th><th>Zona</th><th>Último valor</th><th>Batería</th><th>Señal</th><th>Estado</th></tr></thead><tbody>
